<title>RUSSIA: Yeltsin starts annual state of nation speech.</title>
<headline>Yeltsin starts annual state of nation speech.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Boris Yeltsin began his annual state of the nation speech to the Russian parliament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Yeltsin, 66, was outlining his plans for the months ahead in the speech, broadcast live from the Kremlin on Russian television. It was his first major policy statement since he was re-elected last July.</p>
</text>
